OL,3,GNEWSAThree unions to strike at once
OL,4,Aover Glasgow Caledonian job cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at Glasgow Caledonian University
OL,7,Fare staging strike action, with all
OL,8,Fthree campus unions walking out
OL,9,Ftogether for the first time over
OL,10,Fplanned job cuts.
OL,12,FLecturers and support staff say the
OL,13,Faction by members of the UCU, the EIS
OL,14,Fand Unison on Thursday could
OL,15,Feffectively stop the university from
OL,16,Foperating.
OL,18,FManagement at the university plan to
OL,19,Fcut about 50 posts and say they have
OL,20,Fnot ruled out compulsory redundancies.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
